  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Investment Grant for Satellite Rural Community Broadband (Eutelsat)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Project consists of the deployment of 15.188 ground telecom access points, backhauled via satellite, to deliver basic telecommunication services (voice and data) to underserved rural areas across 20 sub-Saharan Africa countries. Each village will be equipped with a connectivity kit comprising a satellite reception terminal (antenna and modem), solar-powered energy equipment (solar panels and battery), and a Wi-Fi router. The service will deliver affordable data services be accessible to users with low-end smartphones within a 150-meter radius of each hotspot. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
